<p>Hi <%= @user.name %>,</p>

<p>Someone asked to reset your SolidTrace password. To choose a new one, open this link:</p>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Reset your password", @reset_url %>
</p>

<p>The link works for 15 minutes, and only until your password changes. Resetting it signs you out everywhere.</p>

<hr>

<p>
  <small>If you didn't ask, ignore this email: your password stays as it is.</small>
</p>
